# ============================================================================
# Held-back locales (hi, es): disabled in the locale registry, so their pages
# are no longer built. Catch-all redirect any lingering /hi/* or /es/* request
# (old links, bookmarks, crawler retries) to the English home so nothing 404s
# or leaks a soft-404 to search engines. Remove these when a locale goes live.
# ============================================================================
/hi/*   /en/   301
/es/*   /en/   301

